      <figure>
        <caption>The matrix <m>A</m> scales the <m>v_1</m>-direction (violet) by a factor of <m>2</m> and the <m>v_2</m>-direction (green) by a factor of <m>-1</m>.  You should be able to visualize where <m>Ax</m> will be given the location of <m>x</m>.</caption>
        <interactive
            iframe="iframes/eigenspace-if.html?mat=1/2,3/2:3/2,1/2&amp;nomult"
            width="90%"
            aspect="4:3">
          <shortdescription>
            <!-- FILL: Brief alt-text for this interactive (linear algebra context) -->
          </shortdescription>
          <description>
            <!-- FILL: Complete accessibility description of this interactive for a linear algebra course -->
            <p>
              
            </p>
